{"title":"Career Roadmap · Smart City Engineer","role":"Smart City Engineer","summary":"A Smart City Engineer designs, integrates, monitors and improves technology-enabled urban infrastructure. The role combines engineering with IoT, sensors, GIS, urban infrastructure, transportation, energy, water systems, communications, cloud platforms, data analytics and automation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Smart Infrastructure / Smart Cities Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Smart City Engineer designs, integrates, monitors and improves technology-enabled urban infrastructure. The role combines engineering with IoT, sensors, GIS, urban infrastructure, transportation, energy, water systems, communications, cloud platforms, data analytics and automation."},{"type":"p","text":"Smart-city engineering is inherently interdisciplinary. A strong engineer should understand both the physical infrastructure and the digital systems used to monitor and optimize it."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Career Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Urban Infrastructure","IoT","GIS","Sensors","Networking","Cloud","Data Analytics","Automation","Sustainability","Smart Mobility"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","Engineering + Urban Infrastructure Fundamentals","Smart City Systems","IoT + Sensors + GIS + Networking","Cloud + Data Platforms + Analytics","Smart Mobility / Energy / Water / Waste / Buildings","System Integration + Cybersecurity","Smart Infrastructure Project","Internship","Smart City / Infrastructure Engineer","Systems / IoT / Mobility / Urban Technology Engineer","Senior Smart Infrastructure Engineer","Smart City Project / Program Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Horizon","Typical Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Smart Infrastructure Intern"},{"text":"Sensors, GIS, data collection and infrastructure projects"}],[{"text":"Graduate Engineer"},{"text":"Smart infrastructure implementation and monitoring"}],[{"text":"Smart City Engineer"},{"text":"Integrated urban technology systems"}],[{"text":"Smart Infrastructure Engineer"},{"text":"IoT, utilities, buildings and infrastructure"}],[{"text":"Smart Mobility Engineer"},{"text":"Intelligent transportation systems"}],[{"text":"Urban IoT Engineer"},{"text":"Sensors, gateways and connected infrastructure"}],[{"text":"Smart City Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Integration of multiple city platforms"}],[{"text":"Senior Smart Infrastructure Engineer"},{"text":"Architecture, deployment and optimization"}],[{"text":"Smart City Technology Consultant"},{"text":"Large-scale urban transformation projects"}],[{"text":"Smart Infrastructure Program Manager"},{"text":"Multi-domain city projects and strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Tech / B.E.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The most important concept is to avoid becoming only an IoT developer or only an urban-planning student."},{"type":"p","text":"A Smart City Engineer needs to understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical infrastructure"},{"text":"Digital infrastructure"},{"text":"Data infrastructure"},{"text":"Communication networks"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"Urban operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering & Digital Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering Mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering Physics"},{"text":"Engineering Mechanics"},{"text":"Basic Electrical Engineering"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Environmental Engineering"},{"text":"Engineering Drawing"},{"text":"Programming"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"tex